3. Nf3 { Develop and stay flexible; this avoids the pin ...Bb4. } 3... b6
4. g3 { Fianchetto to contest Black's bishop on the long diagonal. } 4... Bb7
5. Bg2 { The bishop fights for e4 and the long diagonal. } 5... Be7
