2. c4 { The Queen's Gambit: challenge d5 with a wing pawn. } 2... e6
( 2... c6 3. Nf3 { Develop first; the Slav is solid, so play it calmly. } 3... Nf6
4. e3 { Protect c4 and open the bishop. } 4... Bf5
5. Nc3 { Develop and keep an eye on e4. } 5... e6
6. Bd3 { Offer to swap Black's good bishop. } 6... Bxd3
7. Qxd3 { Take back with the queen; it now controls e4. } 7... Nbd7
8. O-O { Castle; the plan is e3-e4. } )
